    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/5f6fb3d875d40dad21efd9a6f0c7b111.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>Protobots:</strong><br>Step into an electrifying realm of Protobots, a dystopian retro-future awash with glaring neon, unchecked greed, and a whirlwind of mindless entertainment. In this cybernetic hellscape, where the line between mania and brilliance blurs, you find an unexpected ally...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/9bbc45e1e3967f89df0e9f0aaca1f367.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>38 Alpha Campaign Levels:</strong><br>Drive, walk, fly, tumble, and otherwise attempt to reach the goal in any way possible.<br><strong>Realistic Articulation Body Physics:</strong><br>Utilizing the latest industrial-level robotic simulation technologies, all motion is fully physically simulated at high fidelity with no IK or preset animations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/86c3772055a8fbc5e36b9c50b3c367a0.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>Robot Editor:</strong><br>Construct your own bots, program movement cycles, and bind inputs to bot actions. Save locally or export level bundles to the workshop.<br><strong>Level Editor: </strong><br>Build devious challenges for your bot creation to overcome. Use blocks, bent blocks, and columns to lay out the course, then add props and traps to drive other players insane.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/5f6fb3d875d40dad21efd9a6f0c7b111.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>Protobots:</strong><br>Step into an electrifying realm of Protobots, a dystopian retro-future awash with glaring neon, unchecked greed, and a whirlwind of mindless entertainment. In this cybernetic hellscape, where the line between mania and brilliance blurs, you find an unexpected ally...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/9bbc45e1e3967f89df0e9f0aaca1f367.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>38 Alpha Campaign Levels:</strong><br>Drive, walk, fly, tumble, and otherwise attempt to reach the goal in any way possible.<br><strong>Realistic Articulation Body Physics:</strong><br>Utilizing the latest industrial-level robotic simulation technologies, all motion is fully physically simulated at high fidelity with no IK or preset animations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483200/extras/86c3772055a8fbc5e36b9c50b3c367a0.avif?t=1714138841\" /></span><br><strong>Robot Editor:</strong><br>Construct your own bots, program movement cycles, and bind inputs to bot actions. Save locally or export level bundles to the workshop.<br><strong>Level Editor: </strong><br>Build devious challenges for your bot creation to overcome. Use blocks, bent blocks, and columns to lay out the course, then add props and traps to drive other players insane.",
    "short_description": "Infinite bite-sized robotic challenges await in the neon-drenched world of Protobots! Can you keep your brain case intact, or will you end up in a recycling bin? Try your hand at beating campaign levels, or design your own mechanical nightmares to drive other players insane.",
